00:00:49.140 --> 00:01:05.340
<v Fred Armisen>Well, after that, this writer at SNL, Christine Nangle and I, we figured out a way to turn it into a sketch that we could put on Weekend Update, the news segment on Saturday Night Live. By chance, NPR came up in the news. I think this was around the time that they were talking about cutting some of the funding.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:09.440
<v Seth Meyers>Here to comment on NPR'S troubles, the host of This American Life, Ira Glass.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.040
