00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:18.870
<v Seth Meyers>[LAUGHTER]

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:25.740
<v Seth Meyers>I'm Ira Glass. Act 1. I was thinking the other day--

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:30.250
<v Ira Glass>And the joke being that you were interviewing people at "Weekend Update."

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:44.310
