00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:55.500
<v Ira Glass>So this never made it to air. This is just the recording from the dress rehearsal. Why didn't it make it to air?

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.080
<v Fred Armisen>Who knows? It might have been a little unwieldy.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:24.410
<v Ira Glass>So if people want to watch that, the entire video, we have a link at our website. Anyway, so we invited you here today because the theme of this week's show is doppelgangers. The show is about doppelgangers, about people who are doubles or lookalikes. And I realized that because you had worked up this imitation, you could co-host as my doppelganger in this room, in this studio, during this broadcast. This is an audience who will actually know who you're playing.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.620
<v Fred Armisen>Yes, this is the right venue for it.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:29.930
<v Ira Glass>So if you're ready, that's what we'll do.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:37.840
<v Fred Armisen>Sure. And another way to look at it is, you're co-hosting with me, that this is my show.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:38.350
