00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:55.510
<v Ira Glass>All right, so let's go to this copy. So we have some copy for today. OK. That's this one. And let's go to there. And let's just-- why don't you start?

00:02:55.510 --> 00:03:02.360
<v Fred Armisen>OK. (IMITATING IRA GLASS) Today on our show-- today on our show.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:05.700
<v Ira Glass>Let me think. I'm just thinking about how I would do it. I would go, today on our show--

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:09.440
<v Fred Armisen>Oh, yes. That's better. OK. (IMITATING IRA GLASS) Today on our show--

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:11.610
<v Ira Glass>We have two stories of supposed doppelgangers.

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:17.520
<v Fred Armisen>(IMITATING IRA GLASS) --we have two stories of supposed doppelgangers. And we try to figure out the truth of them.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.310
<v Ira Glass>Do I sound that nasal?

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:20.720
